#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:10
msgid "Dynamic Attention Solver"
msgstr "Dynamic Attention Solver"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:12
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Context Parallelism (CP) shards sequence activations across distributed "
"devices to overcome memory constraints in long-context training. In "
"MagiAttention, the `static attn solver` has largely solved CP scheduling "
"for standard long-context workloads where masks are static or "
"deterministic prior to the iteration (e.g. causal, causal document, "
"sliding window). By leveraging initial token dispatch before the "
"iteration starts, the static solver ensures compute balance across ranks "
"while restricting data movement to **{math}`\\mathrm{KV}`-communication "
"only**, keeping Query/Output ({math}`\\mathrm{QO}`) tokens fixed on their"
" host devices."
msgstr ""
"上下文并行（CP）将序列 activation 分片到分布式设备上，以突破长上下文训练的显存限制。在 "
"MagiAttention 中，`static attn solver` 已基本解决了标准长上下文负载下的 CP "
"调度问题——这些场景中 mask 在 iteration 前是静态或可确定的（如 causal、causal "
"document、sliding window）。通过在 iteration 开始前进行初始 token "
"dispatch，静态 solver 确保各 rank 间的计算均衡，同时将数据搬运限制为 **仅 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 通信**，保持 Query/Output（{math}`\\mathrm{QO}`）token "
"固定在其 home device 上。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:16
msgid "Limitations of the Static Solver"
msgstr "静态 Solver 的局限性"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:18
msgid ""
"To achieve computation load balancing across distributed ranks, the "
"static solver relies on **pre-iteration token dispatch**: it splits the "
"sequence into chunks, estimates the FLOP workload for each chunk, and "
"heuristically dispatches these chunks to CP ranks prior to execution."
msgstr ""
"为实现分布式 rank 间的计算负载均衡，静态 solver 依赖 **迭代前 token "
"dispatch**：将序列切分为多个 chunk，估计每个 chunk 的 FLOP "
"计算量，并在执行前启发式地将这些 chunk dispatch 到各 CP rank。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:20
msgid ""
"Crucially, this approach requires the global attention mask to be "
"**static and fully deterministic before the iteration begins**, so that "
"each chunk's attention FLOP workload can be evaluated in advance to drive"
" the heuristic dispatch algorithm."
msgstr ""
"关键在于，该方法要求全局 attention mask 在 **iteration "
"开始前是静态且完全确定的**，使得每个 chunk 的 attention FLOP 计算量可以提前评估，从而驱动启发式 dispatch 算法。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:22
msgid ""
"However, the static solver faces two fundamental limitations that prevent"
" it from supporting dynamic sparse attention mechanisms:"
msgstr ""
"然而，静态 solver 面临两个根本性限制，使其无法支持动态稀疏 attention 机制："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Runtime Dynamic Sparse Attention**: Architectures such as DeepSeek "
"Sparse Attention (DSA) "
"{cite}`deepseekai2025deepseekv32pushingfrontieropen` and Native Sparse "
"Attention (NSA) {cite}`yuan2025nativesparseattentionhardwarealigned` "
"compute sparse {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` selections at runtime via lightweight"
" indexers during each layer's forward pass. Because the resulting "
"attention masks depend directly on dynamic activation states and learned "
"parameters, mask structure cannot be known prior to iteration execution, "
"making pre-iteration token dispatch completely infeasible."
msgstr ""
"**运行时动态稀疏 Attention**：DeepSeek Sparse Attention (DSA) "
"{cite}`deepseekai2025deepseekv32pushingfrontieropen` 和 Native Sparse "
"Attention (NSA) {cite}`yuan2025nativesparseattentionhardwarealigned` "
"等架构在每层前向中通过轻量级 indexer 在运行时计算稀疏 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` "
"选择。由于产生的 attention mask 直接依赖动态 activation 状态和学习参数，mask "
"结构在 iteration 执行前无法获知，使得迭代前 token dispatch 完全不可行。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:24
msgid ""
"**CPU-Only Mask Representation**: The static solver only accepts **CPU-"
"side mask descriptors** (e.g., mask type enums, document boundary "
"indices). It cannot directly consume attention masks represented as "
"**GPU-resident tensors**. Many modern attention variants naturally "
"produce or manipulate masks as on-device tensors, making them "
"incompatible with the static solver's CPU-only mask interface."
msgstr ""
"**仅支持 CPU 端 Mask 表示**：静态 solver 仅接受 **CPU 端 mask 描述符**"
"（如 mask 类型枚举、文档边界索引）。它无法直接使用以 **GPU 端 tensor** "
"表示的 attention mask。许多现代 attention 变体天然以 device 端 tensor "
"的形式生成或操作 mask，与静态 solver 的 CPU-only mask 接口不兼容。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:26
msgid ""
"These limitations leave the static solver incapable of supporting modern "
"dynamic and device-native attention mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"这些限制使得静态 solver 无法支持现代动态和 device 原生的 attention 机制。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:27
msgid "Core Problem & Design Approach"
msgstr "核心问题与设计思路"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:29
msgid ""
"The core systems challenge in dynamic Context Parallelism is: **under "
"strict activation memory balance constraints (where each rank maintains a"
" uniform sequence shard), how to perform online workload partitioning and"
" compute-communication co-scheduling when token dispatching/reordering is"
" unavailable and attention masks are resolved dynamically at runtime?**"
msgstr ""
"动态上下文并行中的核心系统挑战是：**在严格的 activation 显存均衡约束下（每个 rank "
"持有均匀的序列分片），当 token dispatch/重排不可用且 attention mask 在运行时动态生成时，如何进行在线负载划分和计算-通信协同调度？**"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:31
msgid ""
"To address this, MagiAttention introduces the **`Dynamic Attention "
"Solver`**. The core idea rests on two key design choices:"
msgstr ""
"为此，MagiAttention 引入了 **`Dynamic Attention Solver`**。核心思想基于两个关键设计选择："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Fixed Token Sharding with {math}`\\mathrm{QO}`-Comm Enabled**: Without "
"pre-iteration token dispatch, each rank holds a fixed sequence shard. In "
"this setup, communicating KV only strictly fixes each rank's computation "
"workload. This leaves no room for load rebalancing. Therefore, the solver"
" enables communication for both {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` and "
"{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` (**{math}`\\mathrm{QO}`-comm enabled**). "
"Communicating both {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` and {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` allows "
"any computation workload to be scheduled onto any rank."
msgstr ""
"**固定 Token 分片 + 启用 {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 通信**：无迭代前 token "
"dispatch 时，每个 rank 持有固定的序列分片。此设置下仅通信 KV "
"会严格固定每个 rank 的计算量，没有负载再均衡的空间。因此 solver 同时启用 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 和 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 的通信（**启用 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 通信**）。同时通信 {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 和 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 使得任何计算任务都可以调度到任意 rank。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:34
msgid ""
"**Per-Layer Online Solving**: During each attention layer's forward pass,"
" the dynamic solver perceives the current layer's mask structure, "
"calculates the FLOP workload for each attention tile, and dynamically "
"assigns computation tasks to CP ranks. It balances compute FLOPs across "
"devices while minimizing the maximum communication volume among all ranks"
" (i.e., bottleneck minimization), generating execution metadata "
"(`CalcMeta` and `CommMeta`) **in real time**."
msgstr ""
"**逐层在线求解**：在每个 attention 层的前向过程中，动态 solver 感知当前层的 mask "
"结构，计算每个 attention tile 的 FLOP "
"计算量，并动态地将计算任务分配给各 CP rank。它在各设备间均衡计算 FLOPs "
"的同时最小化所有 rank 的最大通信量（即瓶颈最小化），**实时** 生成执行元数据（`CalcMeta` 和 `CommMeta`）。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:53
msgid ""
"In the following sections, we describe the detailed formulation and "
"scheduling algorithms of the `dynamic attn solver` "
"([Overview](#overview)), present its user interface ([User Interface"
"](#user-interface)), and outline current limitations and future roadmap "
"([Current Limitations & Future Roadmap](#current-limitations--future-"
"roadmap))."
msgstr ""
"以下章节中，我们描述 `dynamic attn solver` 的详细建模和调度算法（[概览](#overview)），介绍其用户接口（[用户接口](#user-interface)），并概述当前局限性和未来路线图（[当前局限性与未来路线图](#current-limitations--future-roadmap)）。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:56
msgid "System Abstraction & Cost Modeling"
msgstr "系统抽象与开销建模"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The **Dynamic Attention Solver** formulates Context Parallelism (CP) "
"scheduling as a **mask-aware online task-to-rank mapping problem without "
"token reordering**. By maintaining sequence tokens in their original, "
"contiguous physical layout {math}`(0..P-1)`, it preserves strict "
"activation memory balance. For each distinct dynamic mask, the solver "
"inspects its structure to perceive true FLOP workloads across "
"{math}`\\mathrm{Q} \\times \\mathrm{KV} \\times \\text{Head}` dimensions."
" Its core objective is to **strictly equalize non-zero compute FLOPs "
"across ranks while minimizing bottleneck "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}`/{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` communication volume**."
msgstr ""
"**Dynamic Attention Solver** 将上下文并行（CP）调度建模为 **感知 mask 的在线 task-to-rank "
"映射问题（无 token 重排）**。通过保持序列 token 在其原始连续物理布局 "
"{math}`(0..P-1)` 中不动，严格保证 activation 显存均衡。对于每个不同的动态 mask，solver 检查其结构以感知 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{Q} \\times \\mathrm{KV} \\times \\text{Head}` "
"维度上的真实 FLOP 计算量。核心目标是 **严格均衡各 rank 的非零计算 FLOPs，同时最小化瓶颈 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}`/{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 通信量**。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:60
#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:68
msgid "Fixed Sequential Sharding"
msgstr "固定顺序分片"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:62
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Without pre-iteration token dispatch, the dynamic solver adopts **fixed "
"sequential sharding** as its default data layout. A sequence of length "
"{math}`S` is evenly partitioned into {math}`P` contiguous chunks "
"{math}`(0..P-1)`, where rank {math}`p` stores the {math}`p`-th chunk. "
"This ensures every rank holds exactly {math}`S/P` tokens, guaranteeing "
"perfectly balanced activation memory across all CP ranks by construction."
msgstr ""
"无迭代前 token dispatch 时，动态 solver 采用 **固定顺序分片** 作为默认数据布局。长度为 "
"{math}`S` 的序列被均匀切分为 {math}`P` 个连续 chunk "
"{math}`(0..P-1)`，rank {math}`p` 存储第 {math}`p` 个 chunk。这确保每个 "
"rank 恰好持有 {math}`S/P` 个 token，天然保证所有 CP rank 的 activation 显存完美均衡。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:64
msgid ""
"Without prior knowledge of the attention mask, sequential sharding serves"
" as an effective mask-agnostic layout that preserves token locality. By "
"storing adjacent tokens on the same rank, it aligns with common attention"
" patterns where neighboring tokens frequently attend to each other. "
"Maintaining this locality increases the proportion of local computation "
"and reduces cross-rank data transfers, making sequential sharding "
"friendly to the dynamic solver."
msgstr ""
"在无 attention mask 先验知识的情况下，顺序分片是一种有效的 mask-agnostic "
"布局，可保持 token locality。将相邻 token 存储在同一 rank "
"上，契合相邻 token 频繁相互 attend 的常见 attention "
"模式。保持该 locality 增加了本地计算占比并减少跨 rank 数据搬运，使顺序分片对动态 solver 友好。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Furthermore, this sharding induces a natural grid structure over the "
"global attention space. With {math}`P` query chunks and {math}`P` key-"
"value chunks, the full {math}`\\mathrm{Q} \\times \\mathrm{KV}` attention"
" matrix is partitioned into a {math}`P \\times P` grid. Block {math}`(i, "
"j)` represents the attention between query chunk {math}`i` and key-value "
"chunk {math}`j`. Blocks on the principal diagonal {math}`(i, i)` are "
"**local** to rank {math}`i`, whereas off-diagonal blocks require "
"communication to compute."
msgstr ""
"此外，该分片在全局 attention 空间上产生自然的网格结构。{math}`P` 个 query chunk 和 "
"{math}`P` 个 key-value chunk 将完整的 {math}`\\mathrm{Q} \\times "
"\\mathrm{KV}` attention 矩阵划分为 {math}`P \\times P` 网格。块 "
"{math}`(i, j)` 表示 query chunk {math}`i` 与 key-value chunk {math}`j` "
"之间的 attention。主对角线块 {math}`(i, i)` 对 rank {math}`i` "
"是 **本地的**，非对角线块则需要通信才能计算。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Illustration of fixed sequential sharding with {math}`P = 4` ranks on a "
"variable-length (varlen) causal mask containing two sequence samples of "
"lengths 21 and 11. The vertical axis represents Query/Output "
"({math}`\\mathrm{QO}`) and the horizontal axis represents Key/Value "
"({math}`\\mathrm{KV}`), both ordered by token ID. Colored entries "
"indicate valid non-masked positions requiring computation. Blue tiles "
"represent {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` stored on rank `r1`, yellow tiles "
"represent {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` stored on rank `r2`, and green tiles "
"represent the cross-rank attention block where {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` "
"resides on `r2` while {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` resides on `r1`. Because "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` and {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` belong to different ranks, "
"the green block cannot be computed locally and strictly requires inter-"
"rank communication."
msgstr ""
"固定顺序分片示意图：在包含长度为 21 和 11 的两条序列的变长（varlen）causal mask 上使用 "
"{math}`P = 4` 个 rank。纵轴为 Query/Output（{math}`\\mathrm{QO}`），横轴为 "
"Key/Value（{math}`\\mathrm{KV}`），均按 token ID 排序。着色条目表示需要计算的有效（非 mask）位置。蓝色 "
"tile 表示存储在 rank `r1` 的 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}`，黄色 tile 表示存储在 rank `r2` "
"的 {math}`\\mathrm{QO}`，绿色 tile 表示跨 rank attention 块——"
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 在 `r2` 而 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 在 `r1`。由于 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 和 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 属于不同 rank，绿色块无法本地计算，必须通过 rank 间通信。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:77
#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:88
msgid "Computation Cost Estimation"
msgstr "计算开销估计"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:79
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computational workload of attention is directly estimated by the "
"**sum of effective mask areas**. Since attention FLOPs scale linearly "
"with the number of valid (non-masked) entries, the global attention space"
" ({math}`\\mathrm{Q} \\times \\mathrm{KV} \\times \\text{Head}`) is "
"partitioned into basic computation blocks {math}`B_{i,j,h}`, where each "
"block represents the sub-matrix computation between query chunk "
"{math}`i`, key-value chunk {math}`j`, and attention head {math}`h`."
msgstr ""
"Attention 的计算量直接通过 **有效 mask 面积之和** 估计。由于 attention FLOPs "
"与有效（非 mask）条目数量线性相关，全局 attention 空间（{math}`\\mathrm{Q} \\times "
"\\mathrm{KV} \\times \\text{Head}`）被划分为基本计算块 "
"{math}`B_{i,j,h}`，每个块表示 query chunk {math}`i`、key-value chunk "
"{math}`j` 和 attention head {math}`h` 之间的子矩阵计算。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:81
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The workload of each block {math}`B_{i,j,h}` is quantified by its "
"**effective mask area** {math}`A(B_{i,j,h})` — defined as the total count"
" of valid (non-masked) entries within that sub-matrix. In practice (e.g.,"
" with packed variable-length sequences, multi-document boundaries, or "
"dynamic sparse masks), a single block may not possess a uniform "
"structure; instead, it can contain a combination of multiple sub-regions,"
" arbitrary shapes, or scattered valid entries. Regardless of the internal"
" layout, {math}`A(B_{i,j,h})` is determined by directly counting the "
"valid non-zero entries in the corresponding mask sub-matrix."
msgstr ""
"每个块 {math}`B_{i,j,h}` 的计算量通过其 **有效 mask 面积** "
"{math}`A(B_{i,j,h})` 量化——定义为该子矩阵内有效（非 mask）条目的总数。实际中（如打包变长序列、多文档边界或动态稀疏 mask），单个块可能没有均匀结构，而是包含多个子区域的组合、任意形状或分散的有效条目。无论内部布局如何，{math}`A(B_{i,j,h})` 均通过直接统计对应 mask 子矩阵中的有效非零条目确定。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:83
msgid "For instance, typical patterns within a block include:"
msgstr "例如，块内典型模式包括："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:84
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Full Mask**: Every entry is valid, yielding {math}`A = S_q \\times S_k`"
" (where {math}`S_q` and {math}`S_k` are the query and key-value chunk "
"sizes)."
msgstr ""
"**Full Mask**：所有条目均有效，{math}`A = S_q \\times S_k`（其中 "
"{math}`S_q` 和 {math}`S_k` 分别为 query 和 key-value chunk 大小）。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:85
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Causal Mask**: Entries are restricted by causality, yielding {math}`A ="
" \\frac{S_q \\times (S_q + 1)}{2}` for diagonal blocks (assuming "
"{math}`S_q = S_k`)."
msgstr ""
"**Causal Mask**：条目受因果约束限制，对角块面积为 {math}`A = \\frac{S_q "
"\\times (S_q + 1)}{2}`（假设 {math}`S_q = S_k`）。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:86
msgid ""
"**Mixed or irregular composition**: The block intersects multiple "
"sequence boundaries or dynamic sparse selections, forming a combination "
"of multiple shapes or sparse patterns."
msgstr ""
"**混合或不规则组合**：块跨越多个序列边界或动态稀疏选择，形成多种形状或稀疏模式的组合。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:94
msgid ""
"Illustration of computation workload estimation based on effective mask "
"area across different block composition cases."
msgstr "基于有效 mask 面积的计算量估计示意图，展示不同块组合情况。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:97
#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:109
msgid "Communication Cost Estimation"
msgstr "通信开销估计"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:99
msgid ""
"When a rank is assigned to compute an attention block whose required data"
" does not fully reside locally, **inter-rank communication** is triggered"
" to transfer the missing data chunks. The communication cost of a data "
"chunk is estimated by its **volume**, defined as the number of tokens in "
"the chunk multiplied by the number of attention heads:"
msgstr ""
"当某个 rank 被分配计算一个所需数据未完全驻留在本地的 attention 块时，会触发 **rank "
"间通信** 以传输缺失的数据 chunk。数据 chunk 的通信开销通过其 **通信量** 估计，定义为 chunk 中的 token 数乘以 attention head 数："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:101
msgid "\\text{Vol}(\\text{chunk}) = S_{\\text{chunk}} \\times H"
msgstr "\\text{Vol}(\\text{chunk}) = S_{\\text{chunk}} \\times H"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:105
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Taking the **forward pass** as an example: computing an attention block "
"requires {math}`\\mathrm{Q}`, {math}`\\mathrm{K}`, {math}`\\mathrm{V}` as"
" inputs and produces {math}`\\mathrm{O}` and {math}`\\text{lse}` (log-"
"sum-exp) as outputs. Since the size of {math}`\\text{lse}` is negligible "
"compared to activation tensors, it is omitted from cost estimation. "
"Therefore, a {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` chunk communication transfers "
"{math}`\\mathrm{Q}` to the computing rank and {math}`\\mathrm{O}` back, "
"while a {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` chunk communication transfers "
"{math}`\\mathrm{K}` and {math}`\\mathrm{V}` together."
msgstr ""
"以 **前向** 为例：计算一个 attention 块需要 {math}`\\mathrm{Q}`、{math}`\\mathrm{K}`、"
"{math}`\\mathrm{V}` 作为输入，产生 {math}`\\mathrm{O}` 和 "
"{math}`\\text{lse}`（log-sum-exp）作为输出。由于 {math}`\\text{lse}` "
"相对于 activation tensor 大小可忽略，在开销估计中省略。因此一次 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` chunk 通信将 {math}`\\mathrm{Q}` 发送到计算 rank 并将 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{O}` 回传，而一次 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` chunk 通信将 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{K}` 和 {math}`\\mathrm{V}` 一起传输。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each communication event involves a **sender** and a **receiver**: when a"
" data chunk is transferred from rank {math}`s` to rank {math}`d`, the "
"transfer simultaneously increases rank {math}`s`'s **send volume** and "
"rank {math}`d`'s **receive volume**. The solver tracks per-rank send and "
"receive volumes separately, as both directions contribute to the overall "
"communication bottleneck. Its secondary objective is to **minimize the "
"maximum communication volume across all ranks** (bottleneck "
"minimization), preventing any single rank from becoming a communication "
"straggler."
msgstr ""
"每次通信涉及一个 **sender** 和一个 **receiver**：当数据 chunk 从 rank {math}`s` "
"传输到 rank {math}`d` 时，同时增加 rank {math}`s` 的 **send volume** 和 rank "
"{math}`d` 的 **recv volume**。Solver 分别跟踪每个 rank 的 send/recv "
"volume，因为两个方向都贡献于整体通信瓶颈。其次要目标是 **最小化所有 rank "
"中的最大通信量**（瓶颈最小化），防止任何单个 rank 成为通信 straggler。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:115
msgid ""
"Illustration of communication cost estimation. Under {math}`P = 4` "
"sequential sharding, the red attention tile (bottom right) is scheduled "
"on rank 3 (r3). While r3 exhibits high data locality for this task, a "
"partial dependency triggers a remote fetch from r2. This cross-rank "
"transfer costs {math}`S_{\\text{chunk}} \\times H`, incrementing r2's and"
" r3's communication volumes. Remote fetch overhead is amortized via data "
"reuse when multiple local tiles share the same chunk."
msgstr ""
"通信开销估计示意图。在 {math}`P = 4` 顺序分片下，红色 attention tile（右下角）被调度到 rank 3 "
"(r3)。虽然 r3 对该任务有较高的数据 locality，但部分依赖触发了从 r2 的远程 fetch。该跨 rank "
"传输开销为 {math}`S_{\\text{chunk}} \\times H`，增加 r2 和 r3 "
"的通信量。当多个本地 tile 共享同一 chunk 时，远程 fetch 开销通过数据复用得以摊销。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:118
msgid "Optimization Model"
msgstr "优化模型"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:120
msgid ""
"The online solver searches for an optimal block-to-rank mapping "
"{math}`\\mathcal{M}: \\{B_{i,j,h}\\} \\to \\{0, \\dots, P-1\\}` that "
"optimizes communication and computation overlap under strict memory and "
"dependency constraints:"
msgstr ""
"在线 solver 搜索最优的 block-to-rank 映射 {math}`\\mathcal{M}: \\{B_{i,j,h}\\} \\to "
"\\{0, \\dots, P-1\\}`，在严格的显存和依赖约束下优化通信与计算的 overlap："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:122
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Compute Load Balance Constraint**: Rather than a strict minimization, "
"compute balance is formulated as an inequality constraint using an "
"imbalance ratio {math}`\\mu`. For each rank {math}`r`, its assigned "
"workload must be strictly less than {math}`\\mu` times the total global "
"workload:"
msgstr ""
"**计算负载均衡约束**：计算均衡不作为严格最小化问题，而是使用 imbalance ratio {math}`\\mu` "
"建模为不等式约束。对每个 rank {math}`r`，其分配的计算量必须严格小于 {math}`\\mu` 乘以全局总计算量："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:123
msgid ""
"\\sum_{B \\in \\mathcal{M}^{-1}(r)} A(B) < \\mu \\sum_{p=0}^{P-1} "
"\\sum_{B \\in \\mathcal{M}^{-1}(p)} A(B)"
msgstr ""
"\\sum_{B \\in \\mathcal{M}^{-1}(r)} A(B) < \\mu \\sum_{p=0}^{P-1} "
"\\sum_{B \\in \\mathcal{M}^{-1}(p)} A(B)"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:126
msgid ""
"**Bottleneck Communication Minimization**: Minimize the maximum "
"unidirectional communication volume (either send or receive) across all "
"ranks, preventing network stragglers:"
msgstr ""
"**瓶颈通信最小化**：最小化所有 rank 中最大的单向通信量（send 或 recv），防止网络 straggler："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:127
msgid ""
"\\min_{\\mathcal{M}} \\max_{r \\in [0, P-1]} \\max \\left( "
"\\text{SendVol}(r), \\text{RecvVol}(r) \\right)"
msgstr ""
"\\min_{\\mathcal{M}} \\max_{r \\in [0, P-1]} \\max \\left( "
"\\text{SendVol}(r), \\text{RecvVol}(r) \\right)"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:130
msgid ""
"**Local Priority & Overlap Maximization**: Prioritize assigning local "
"tasks to their host ranks. This allows the system to immediately begin "
"local computation, effectively overlapping it with the communication "
"required for remote tasks."
msgstr ""
"**本地优先与 Overlap 最大化**：优先将本地任务分配给其 home rank。使系统可以立即开始本地计算，有效地与远程任务所需的通信 overlap。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:132
msgid "Dynamic Solver Algorithm"
msgstr "动态 Solver 算法"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:134
msgid ""
"Given the optimization model defined above, the dynamic solver employs a "
"**binary-search-driven greedy heuristic** to find a near-optimal block-"
"to-rank mapping in real time. The algorithm is designed for "
"parallelizable execution on multi-core CPUs with millisecond-level "
"latency."
msgstr ""
"基于上述优化模型，动态 solver 采用 **二分搜索驱动的贪心启发式算法** 实时寻找近优的 block-to-rank "
"映射。算法设计为可在多核 CPU 上并行执行，毫秒级耗时。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:136
msgid "Algorithm Pipeline"
msgstr "算法流水线"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:138
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The solver runs three stages inside a binary search loop over the "
"communication threshold {math}`K`:"
msgstr "Solver 在对通信阈值 {math}`K` 的二分搜索循环内执行三个阶段："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:166
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Stage 1: Candidate Edge Scoring & Greedy Selection.** Each candidate "
"communication edge represents transferring a {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` or "
"{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` chunk from its host rank to a computing rank. The "
"solver scores each edge by a benefit-to-cost ratio:"
msgstr ""
"**Stage 1：候选边评分与贪心选择。** 每条候选通信边表示将一个 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 或 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` chunk 从其 home rank "
"传输到计算 rank。Solver 按收益/开销比对每条边评分："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:169
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\text{score}(e) = \\frac{W(e)}{C(e)}"
msgstr "\\text{score}(e) = \\frac{W(e)}{C(e)}"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:173
msgid ""
"where {math}`W(e)` estimates the compute workload that edge {math}`e` "
"would unlock for the target rank (combining already-assigned tasks, a "
"fraction of unassigned tasks, and a smoothing term), and {math}`C(e) = "
"S_{\\text{chunk}} \\times H` is the communication cost. Edges are sorted "
"by score in descending order and greedily accepted as long as neither the"
" sender's nor receiver's accumulated cost exceeds threshold {math}`K`."
msgstr ""
"其中 {math}`W(e)` 估计边 {math}`e` "
"为目标 rank 解锁的计算量（综合已分配任务、未分配任务的占比和平滑项），{math}`C(e) = "
"S_{\\text{chunk}} \\times H` 为通信开销。边按 score 降序排列并贪心接受，只要 sender 和 receiver 的累积开销均未超过阈值 "
"{math}`K`。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:175
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Stage 2: Greedy Task Assignment.** After edge selection determines data"
" accessibility, the solver constructs a **bitmask of executable ranks** "
"for each grid task {math}`B_{i,j}` by intersecting the "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}`-reachable ranks for chunk {math}`i` and "
"{math}`\\mathrm{KV}`-reachable ranks for chunk {math}`j`. Tasks are "
"sorted by ascending degree (number of candidate ranks) and descending "
"area, then assigned with the following priority:"
msgstr ""
"**Stage 2：贪心任务分配。** 边选择确定数据可达性后，solver 为每个网格任务 "
"{math}`B_{i,j}` 构建 **可执行 rank 的 bitmask**——取 chunk {math}`i` 的 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 可达 rank 集合与 chunk {math}`j` 的 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 可达 rank "
"集合的交集。任务按 degree（候选 rank 数）升序、area 降序排序，然后按以下优先级分配："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:178
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Local priority**: if both {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` and {math}`\\mathrm{KV}`"
" reside on the same rank, assign locally (zero communication cost)."
msgstr ""
"**Local priority**：若 {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 和 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` "
"都在同一 rank 上，则本地分配（零通信开销）。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:179
msgid ""
"**USP heuristic**: prefer the rank suggested by head-group affinity "
"mapping."
msgstr "**USP heuristic**：优先选择 head-group affinity mapping 建议的 rank。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:180
msgid ""
"**Min-load fallback**: choose the candidate rank with the smallest "
"current load."
msgstr "**Min-load fallback**：选择当前负载最小的候选 rank。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:182
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Stage 3: Local Refinement.** After initial assignment, the solver "
"performs a bounded number of refinement passes. For each task currently "
"on an overloaded rank (load exceeding {math}`\\mu \\times \\bar{L}`), it "
"attempts migration to a lower-load candidate rank. This step reduces the "
"maximum compute imbalance without changing the overall assignment "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"**Stage 3：局部精调。** 初始分配后，solver "
"执行有限次精调 pass。对于当前位于过载 rank（负载超过 {math}`\\mu \\times \\bar{L}`）上的每个任务，尝试迁移到负载更低的候选 "
"rank。该步骤在不改变整体分配结构的前提下降低最大计算 imbalance。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:185
msgid "Benchmark"
msgstr "Benchmark"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:187
msgid ""
"**Solving Latency.** Under GQA (64:8 heads) with per-device sequence "
"length 8192, the solver completes within 30 ms for all mask types (full, "
"causal, full document, causal document) at CP ≤ 64. For document-sparse "
"masks specifically, solving stays below 45 ms up to CP = 128. Under MHA "
"(64:64 heads), the task count inflates by ~8× due to head-dimension "
"flattening; document-sparse masks remain within 32 ms at CP ≤ 32."
msgstr ""
"**求解耗时。** 在 GQA（64:8 heads）、per-device 序列长度 8192 条件下，solver 在 CP ≤ 64 "
"时对所有 mask 类型（full、causal、full document、causal document）均在 30 ms "
"内完成。对 document-sparse mask，CP = 128 时求解仍低于 45 ms。在 "
"MHA（64:64 heads）下，由于 head 维度展平，任务数膨胀约 8×；document-sparse "
"mask 在 CP ≤ 32 时仍在 32 ms 内完成。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:189
msgid ""
"**Communication Volume.** Under GQA (64:8) with variable-length document "
"packing on 8–64 GPUs (H100), the dynamic solver reduces communication "
"volume relative to USP:"
msgstr ""
"**通信量。** 在 GQA（64:8）、8–64 GPU（H100）变长文档 packing 条件下，动态 solver 相对 USP 减少了通信量："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:190
msgid "**Full document mask**: forward −48%~55%, backward −6%~42%."
msgstr "**Full document mask**：forward −48%~55%，backward −6%~42%。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:191
msgid "**Causal document mask**: forward −62%~70%, backward −33%~64%."
msgstr "**Causal document mask**：forward −62%~70%，backward −33%~64%。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:194
msgid "Overlapped Execution"
msgstr "Overlapped Execution"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:196
msgid ""
"Once the solver determines the block-to-rank mapping, the remaining "
"problem is how to overlap communication with computation during "
"execution. As the simplest possible design, the current implementation "
"adopts a **two-stage** execution model — just a **local stage** and a "
"**remote stage** — and generates `CalcMeta` and `CommMeta` to drive each "
"stage. More sophisticated multi-stage pipelining is left for future work."
msgstr ""
"Solver 确定 block-to-rank 映射后，剩余问题是如何在执行中将通信与计算 overlap。作为最简设计，当前实现采用 "
"**two-stage** 执行模型——仅一个 **local stage** 和一个 **remote stage**——并生成 "
"`CalcMeta` 和 `CommMeta` 驱动各阶段。更复杂的多阶段 pipelining 留待未来工作。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:198
msgid "Two-Stage Execution Model"
msgstr "Two-Stage 执行模型"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:200
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Stage 0 (Local):** Each rank immediately begins computing attention "
"tasks whose {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` and {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` data both "
"reside locally — no communication is needed. In parallel, the "
"communication stream starts fetching remote {math}`\\mathrm{Q}`, "
"{math}`\\mathrm{K}`, {math}`\\mathrm{V}` chunks required by the next "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"**Stage 0（Local）：** 每个 rank 立即开始计算 {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 和 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{KV}` 数据均在本地的 attention 任务——无需通信。同时，通信 stream 开始 fetch 下一阶段所需的远程 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{Q}`、{math}`\\mathrm{K}`、{math}`\\mathrm{V}` chunk。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:202
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Stage 1 (Remote):** After remote data arrives, each rank computes "
"attention tasks that depend on non-local chunks. Once computation "
"finishes, the output {math}`\\mathrm{O}` is sent back (reduced) to the "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` host rank."
msgstr ""
"**Stage 1（Remote）：** 远程数据到达后，每个 rank 计算依赖非本地 chunk "
"的 attention 任务。计算完成后，输出 {math}`\\mathrm{O}` 被 reduce 回 "
"{math}`\\mathrm{QO}` 的 home rank。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:204
msgid "Two-Stage Overlapped Execution"
msgstr "Two-Stage Overlapped Execution"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:210
msgid ""
"Illustration of the two-stage overlapped execution model. Local attention"
" computation overlaps with remote data fetching on separate CUDA streams."
msgstr "Two-stage overlapped execution 模型示意图。本地 attention 计算与远程数据 fetch 在独立 CUDA stream 上 overlap。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:213
msgid ""
"The solver's local-priority assignment directly maximizes Stage 0 "
"workload. The more local computation available, the more communication "
"latency can be hidden behind useful work."
msgstr ""
"Solver 的 local-priority 分配策略直接最大化 Stage 0 计算量。本地计算越多，能被有效计算隐藏的通信延迟就越多。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:215
msgid "CalcMeta & CommMeta"
msgstr "CalcMeta & CommMeta"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:217
msgid ""
"The solver output is encoded into two metadata objects that fully specify"
" the execution plan:"
msgstr "Solver 输出编码为两个完整描述执行计划的 metadata 对象："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:219
msgid "**`CalcMeta`**: records the attention tasks for each stage."
msgstr "**`CalcMeta`**：记录每个 stage 的 attention 任务。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:220
msgid "`local_attn_arg`: list of `(q_range, k_range, mask_type)` for Stage 0."
msgstr "`local_attn_arg`：Stage 0 的 `(q_range, k_range, mask_type)` 列表。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:221
msgid ""
"`remote_attn_args_list`: list of `(q_range, k_range, mask_type)` for "
"Stage 1, with ranges expressed in local buffer coordinates."
msgstr ""
"`remote_attn_args_list`：Stage 1 的 `(q_range, k_range, mask_type)` 列表，range 以 local buffer 坐标表示。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:223
msgid "**`CommMeta`**: records the data movement plan per stage."
msgstr "**`CommMeta`**：记录每个 stage 的数据搬运计划。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:224
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`num_remote_kv_tokens_per_stage`: number of remote {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` "
"tokens to receive at each stage."
msgstr ""
"`num_remote_kv_tokens_per_stage`：每个 stage 需接收的远程 {math}`\\mathrm{KV}` token 数。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:225
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`kv_group_collective_args_list`: per-stage `GroupCollectiveArg` "
"specifying how to group-cast {math}`\\mathrm{K}`, {math}`\\mathrm{V}` "
"(forward) or group-reduce {math}`\\mathrm{dK}`, {math}`\\mathrm{dV}` "
"(backward)."
msgstr ""
"`kv_group_collective_args_list`：per-stage `GroupCollectiveArg`，指定如何 "
"group-cast {math}`\\mathrm{K}`、{math}`\\mathrm{V}`（forward）或 group-reduce "
"{math}`\\mathrm{dK}`、{math}`\\mathrm{dV}`（backward）。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:226
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`num_remote_qo_tokens_per_stage`: number of remote {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` "
"tokens to receive at each stage."
msgstr ""
"`num_remote_qo_tokens_per_stage`：每个 stage 需接收的远程 {math}`\\mathrm{QO}` token 数。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:227
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`qo_group_collective_args_list`: per-stage `GroupCollectiveArg` "
"specifying how to group-cast {math}`\\mathrm{Q}` (forward) or group-"
"reduce {math}`\\mathrm{dQ}` (backward), and how to reduce "
"{math}`\\mathrm{O}` back to host ranks."
msgstr ""
"`qo_group_collective_args_list`：per-stage `GroupCollectiveArg`，指定如何 "
"group-cast {math}`\\mathrm{Q}`（forward）或 group-reduce "
"{math}`\\mathrm{dQ}`（backward），以及如何将 {math}`\\mathrm{O}` reduce 回 home rank。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:229
msgid ""
"Each `GroupCollectiveArg` contains: `input_split_size_list` (how to split"
" local data for sending), `output_split_size_list` (expected receive "
"sizes), `dst_indices_list` (target ranks for each send chunk), and "
"`src_index_list` (source rank for each receive chunk)."
msgstr ""
"每个 `GroupCollectiveArg` 包含：`input_split_size_list`（如何切分本地数据以发送）、"
"`output_split_size_list`（预期接收大小）、`dst_indices_list`（每个 send chunk 的目标 "
"rank）和 `src_index_list`（每个 recv chunk 的源 rank）。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:232
msgid "User Interface"
msgstr "用户接口"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:234
msgid ""
"The dynamic solver is activated by enabling **QO-communication mode** in "
"MagiAttention's environment configuration. Once enabled, the system "
"automatically switches from the static solver to the dynamic solver path."
msgstr ""
"通过在 MagiAttention 环境配置中启用 **QO-communication 模式** 激活动态 solver。启用后系统自动从静态 solver 切换到动态 solver 路径。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:236
msgid "Environment Configuration"
msgstr "环境配置"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:246
msgid ""
"The API usage is identical to the static solver — users call "
"`magi_attn_flex_key` → `dispatch` → `calc_attn` → `undispatch` as usual. "
"When `MAGI_ATTENTION_QO_COMM=1` is set, the system automatically switches"
" to the dynamic solver path internally, invoking "
"`DynamicAttnSolver.solve()` → `make_calc_meta()` → `make_comm_meta()` → "
"`dist_attn_func()` and caching results for repeated mask patterns. No "
"code changes are needed beyond setting the environment variable."
msgstr ""
"API 用法与静态 solver 完全一致——用户照常调用 `magi_attn_flex_key` → `dispatch` → "
"`calc_attn` → `undispatch`。设置 `MAGI_ATTENTION_QO_COMM=1` "
"后，系统内部自动切换到动态 solver 路径，依次调用 `DynamicAttnSolver.solve()` → "
"`make_calc_meta()` → `make_comm_meta()` → "
"`dist_attn_func()`，并对重复 mask pattern 缓存结果。除设置环境变量外无需代码改动。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:248
msgid "Direct Solver API"
msgstr "直接 Solver API"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:250
msgid ""
"For advanced use cases (e.g., simulation, benchmarking, or custom "
"execution pipelines), the solver can be invoked directly:"
msgstr ""
"对于高级用例（如 simulation、benchmarking 或自定义执行 pipeline），可直接调用 solver："

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:279
msgid "Current Limitations & Future Roadmap"
msgstr "当前局限性与未来路线图"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:281
msgid "Current Limitations"
msgstr "当前局限性"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:283
msgid ""
"**Host-side solving**: The solver currently runs on CPU. For dynamic "
"sparse attention where masks are generated by on-device indexers, "
"transferring mask metadata from device to host introduces a "
"synchronization barrier."
msgstr ""
"**Host 端求解**：Solver 当前运行在 CPU 上。对于 mask 由 device 端 indexer 生成的动态稀疏 attention，将 mask metadata 从 device 搬到 host 会引入 sync barrier。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:285
msgid ""
"**Two-stage overlap only**: The current execution engine supports a "
"single local + single remote stage. Multi-stage pipelining is not yet "
"implemented, limiting overlap efficiency."
msgstr ""
"**仅 two-stage overlap**：当前执行引擎仅支持单个 local + 单个 remote stage。多阶段 pipelining 尚未实现，限制了 overlap 效率。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:287
msgid ""
"**CPU overhead at large CP scales**: The solver time increases as the CP "
"count grows, resulting in higher CPU overhead."
msgstr ""
"**大规模 CP 下的 CPU 开销**：随 CP 数增长 solver 耗时增加，导致更高的 CPU overhead。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:289
msgid "Future Roadmap"
msgstr "未来路线图"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:291
msgid ""
"**Device-side solver**: Design a parallel-friendly solver algorithm that "
"runs directly on device, eliminating host-device synchronization and CPU "
"overhead. The solver would take mask metadata as on-device tensors and "
"output `CalcMeta`/`CommMeta` entirely on device side, achieving better "
"scalability as CP count grows."
msgstr ""
"**Device 端 solver**：设计并行友好的 solver 算法直接在 device 上运行，消除 host-device sync 和 CPU "
"开销。Solver 将 mask metadata 作为 device 端 tensor 输入，完全在 device 端输出 "
"`CalcMeta`/`CommMeta`，随 CP 数增长实现更好的扩展性。"

#: ../../source/blog/dynamic_solver.md:293
msgid ""
"**Multi-stage overlapped execution**: Extend the execution engine to "
"support N-stage pipelining, where remote tasks are further decomposed "
"into sub-stages with interleaved communication and computation, "
"maximizing overlap for high-communication workloads."
msgstr ""
"**多阶段 overlapped execution**：扩展执行引擎支持 N-stage "
"pipelining，将远程任务进一步分解为交错通信和计算的 sub-stage，最大化高通信负载下的 overlap。"

